WEBVTT

00:02:59.425 --> 00:03:01.302
I’m not suggesting literally

00:03:01.302 --> 00:03:04.138
that executives huddle around
a conference table

00:03:04.138 --> 00:03:06.515
with a big pile of Lego bricks --

00:03:06.515 --> 00:03:08.601
although I’ve done that,
and that works too.

00:03:09.810 --> 00:03:14.774
But instead, I’ve created a series
of imagination games

00:03:14.774 --> 00:03:17.151
to help executives
to stretch their thinking.

00:03:17.902 --> 00:03:19.403
Would you like to play with me?

00:03:19.403 --> 00:03:20.404
(Audience nods)

00:03:20.404 --> 00:03:21.864
Good, I'm glad you said that.

00:03:22.823 --> 00:03:28.037
OK, so let’s supposing
that you’re stuck in the rut

00:03:28.037 --> 00:03:31.666
of seeing the world through the lens
of your past and current success.